id: SCA-010
title: Suspicious npm lifecycle script with network call
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: package.json
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: "(postinstall|preinstall|install|prepare|prepublish)"\s*:\s*"[^"]*\b(curl|wget|node\s+-e|python|bash\s+-c|powershell|nc\s|ncat\s)
    message: Lifecycle script makes network call — common supply chain attack vector (axios 2026, Mastra 2026). Malicious packages download and execute payloads during npm install.
fix: Remove network-calling lifecycle scripts. Audit any package with install hooks. Use --ignore-scripts during install and explicitly allow trusted scripts.
